---
/**
 * Offer component — "Where I am most useful" section
 * Displays 3 numbered offer cards describing Bella's core services.
 *
 * To edit: update the card titles and descriptions directly below.
 */
---

<section class="offer wrap" id="offer">
  <div class="offer-head">
    <h2>Where I am most useful</h2>
    <p class="offer-intro">Usually when the problem does not sit neatly inside one organisation, the data are imperfect, and senior decision-makers need more than a technically correct report.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="offer-grid">
    <article class="offer-card">
      <span class="num">01</span>
      <h3>Health economics &amp; evaluation</h3>
      <p>Decision-focused evaluation, value for money, cost and pathway analysis, and proportionate modelling that is explicit about uncertainty and attribution.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="offer-card">
      <span class="num">02</span>
      <h3>Funding, pathways &amp; service design</h3>
      <p>Following patients, activity and money across organisational boundaries to redesign payment mechanisms, commissioning arrangements and care pathways.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="offer-card">
      <span class="num">03</span>
      <h3>Strategic programme review</h3>
      <p>Helping boards, funders and programme leaders establish what is working, what is recoverable, and what should be continued, changed or stopped.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
